1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,915
In sixteen forty-five,

2
00:00:01,965 --> 00:00:03,495
if your baby fell sick,

3
00:00:03,545 --> 00:00:05,279
you didn't fetch a doctor.

4
00:00:05,329 --> 00:00:07,336
You boiled a bottle of pins.

5
00:00:07,726 --> 00:00:09,211
That winter,

6
00:00:09,261 --> 00:00:10,941
I was nine.

7
00:00:10,991 --> 00:00:12,611
Six of us in one room.

8
00:00:12,661 --> 00:00:13,181
The pig behind a hurdle.

9
00:00:13,231 --> 00:00:14,468
Smoke in the rafters.

10
00:00:14,538 --> 00:00:17,876
Three babies in our lane had died since harvest.

11
00:00:18,026 --> 00:00:20,378
Then my sister started to cough.

12
00:00:20,768 --> 00:00:22,523
Gran said it wasn't the cold.

13
00:00:22,573 --> 00:00:23,804
It was someone.

14
00:00:24,034 --> 00:00:27,201
She took down the stone jug with the bearded face.

15
00:00:27,251 --> 00:00:28,151
Bent pins.

16
00:00:28,201 --> 00:00:29,271
Iron nails.

17
00:00:29,321 --> 00:00:31,253
A lock of the baby's hair.

18
00:00:31,303 --> 00:00:32,888
And one long grey hair,

19
00:00:32,938 --> 00:00:34,866
from a comb I'd never seen.

20
00:00:35,256 --> 00:00:36,701
She set it in the embers,

21
00:00:36,751 --> 00:00:38,211
and told me the rule.

22
00:00:38,261 --> 00:00:40,921
Whoever cursed the baby would feel every pin.

23
00:00:40,971 --> 00:00:42,451
In her own body.

24
00:00:42,521 --> 00:00:45,493
And she'd have to come to our door to make it stop.

25
00:00:45,963 --> 00:00:46,628
We sat up.

26
00:00:46,678 --> 00:00:47,823
The fire ticked.

27
00:00:47,873 --> 00:00:49,788
The jug began to hiss.

28
00:00:49,938 --> 00:00:50,708
At midnight,

29
00:00:50,758 --> 00:00:52,511
the baby stopped coughing.

30
00:00:52,981 --> 00:00:54,528
And someone knocked.

31
00:00:55,158 --> 00:00:56,328
Gran didn't move.

32
00:00:56,378 --> 00:00:57,043
She said,

33
00:00:57,093 --> 00:00:57,967
open it.

34
00:00:58,117 --> 00:00:59,472
It burns.
